# November 22, 2026: Wayne County, New York (Lyons, Clyde, Lock Berlin, Newark, Hydesville, Palmyra, Macedon, Sodus,
# Sodus Point, Alton, Wallington, Pultneyville, Ontario, Butler). Drawn at random by tools/choose.py --state ny (region
# cny, which offered Lyons); the Atlas had nothing in Wayne County. Sources opened in this session: Wikipedia as raw
# text (the Wayne County Register list and the articles linked), HMdb marker pages, eriecanal.org (Frank Sadowski's
# Traces of the Erie Canal), the Erie Canalway National Heritage Corridor, Trail Works (Wayne County trails), the
# Museum of Wayne County History, the Lyons Heritage Society, Sodus Bay Lighthouse Museum, Historic Palmyra, the Church
# of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints' pages for the Grandin Printshop and the Sacred Grove Welcome Center, Heritage
# Square Museum, Cracker Box Palace, the Genesee Land Trust, the Newark-Arcadia Historical Society and the Cobblestone
# Museum's structures catalogue.
